{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-mcp","title":"为何需要 MCP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations/why-mcp","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"mcp-architecture","title":"架构 host/client/server","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations/mcp-architecture","wordCount":1450,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"protocol-jsonrpc","title":"协议与 JSON-RPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-context-protocol-mcp/foundations/protocol-jsonrpc","wordCount":1354,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>要实现一个合规的 MCP server，或者只是读懂别人写的 server 在做什么，都得先有三块地基：动机、角色、线路。这一章按这个顺序铺。</p>\n<p>第一篇回答「为何需要 MCP」。这不是营销话术，而是一个具体的工程账：当你有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个 AI 客户端要接 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个工具，没有协议时你要写 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M \\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 份适配代码，有了协议就只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M+N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 份。理解这个 M×N 折叠，你才知道 MCP 的每一处设计是在为谁省力。</p>\n<p>第二篇拆「架构 host/client/server」。MCP 不是简单的客户端-服务器两层，而是 host 进程内可以挂多个 client、每个 client 一对一连一个 server 的三层结构。这层划分决定了能力边界、信任边界和故障隔离，是后面所有原语行为的舞台。</p>\n<p>第三篇落到「协议与 JSON-RPC」。MCP 的每一条消息都是一个 JSON-RPC 2.0 的请求、响应或通知；现行规范里每个请求还要在 <code>_meta</code> 里自报协议版本与能力（2026-07-28 起不再有一次性握手）。把这一层吃透，后面读任何抓包或日志都不再陌生。</p>\n<p>读完本章，你应当能在白纸上画出一条从 host 到 server 的完整连接，并说清每一跳传的是什么。接着可以进入<a href=\"../primitives/\">原语</a>章，看这条线路上实际流动的「积木」。</p>\n"}